            "width": 1432,
            "text": "CREST EXPENSE INTELLIGENCE / REVIEW WORKFLOW Crest Crest is an expense intelligence workspace for reviewing requests with budget, spend history and policy context. It helps finance teams spot unusual patterns and prepare requests for preapproval; a person reviews the context and decides what happens next. SAMPLE DATA Expense review / policy context / preapproval WATCH DEMO ↗"
          },
          {
            "id": "crest-system",
            "top": 642,
            "height": 502,
            "width": 1432,
            "text": "One transaction. Two sources. Human review. Transactions move through deterministic finance and policy checks. Rule-based signals and retrieved policy context support review; people retain decision authority. A sample expense branches into deterministic budget and spend checks and retrieved policy context interpreted by Gemini; both inform human review. 01 REQUEST 02 TWO EVIDENCE PATHS 03 HUMAN DECISION SAMPLE REQUEST Conference registration $1,200 TRAVEL & EVENTS DETERMINISTIC SIGNALS Budget + spend rules Budget · prior spend · thresholds RETRIEVED POLICY Relevant passages Matched to the request POLICY INTERPRETATION Gemini Reads retrieved policy context DECISION AUTHORITY HUMAN REVIEW A reviewer weighs the context and chooses the next action. APPROVE DENY FINANCE Q&A + REPORTING FINANCE "
          },
          {
            "id": "crest-policy",
            "top": 1224,
            "height": 395,
            "width": 1432,
            "text": "DECISION SYSTEM / GROUNDED POLICY, DETERMINISTIC AUTHORITY Policy context. Deterministic decisions. A standalone prototype indexed a Brim policy PDF and retrieved passages for Gemini; a live endpoint or deployed workflow was not verified. Finance and policy rules remained authoritative; anomaly heuristics surfaced review cues. 01 BRIM POLICY PDF Brim source material → 02 EXTRACT + CHUNK Prepare searchable passages → 03 gemini-embedding-001 3,072 dimensions → 04 ATLAS VECTOR SEARCH MongoDB Atlas · policy_chunks → 05 GROUNDED PROMPT Top retrieved passages RETRIEVED POLICY CONTEXT Gemini interpreted the top retrieved passages. Grounded context supported review; it did not detect or decide. + DETERMINISTIC RULES + SIGNALS Finance and policy rules remained authoritative. Heuristic split cue: gr"
          },
          {
            "id": "crest-team",
            "top": 1699,
            "height": 191,
            "width": 1432,
            "text": "TECHNICAL OWNERSHIP I built backend workflows for human review. I built Policy Compliance Engine workflows, deterministic anomaly signals, policy retrieval, and part of preapproval. WORK I BUILT POLICY ENGINE Compliance workflows ANOMALY SIGNALS Deterministic rules POLICY RETRIEVAL Relevant passages PREAPPROVAL Part of the workflow 3RD PLACE BRIM FINANCIAL CHALLENGE · MPC HACKS 2026 PROJECT RECORD ↗"
          },
          {
